  "narrative": {
    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** PubMatic is strengthening its shift to an AI-first supply-side platform, where its AgenticOS ecosystem powers over a thousand AI-driven deals and embeds agents that automate campaign workflows. This pivot offsets demand-side platform headwinds in the programmatic landscape and opens fresh avenues, highlighted by a landmark partnership with the Untapped Growth Collective that brings sophisticated AI buying tools to mid-market and independent agencies, expanding reach beyond dominant walled gardens.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Leadership is executing decisively on an AI-first reinvention, consistently beating guidance on both revenue and adjusted EBITDA. The rollout of AgenticOS and the strategic UGC alliance show a focused effort to democratize advanced automation. Concurrently, management is returning capital via share buybacks, generating rising operating cash flow, and issuing confident forward guidance—moves that reinforce market credibility and a disciplined growth posture.",
